<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Freelance Tax Toolkit — who built it and how the calculators are maintained.">
  <h1>About Freelance Tax Toolkit</h1>
  <p>
    Freelance Tax Toolkit is an independently built set of free calculators for freelancers, 1099
    contractors, and small business owners. It's built and maintained by a solo developer — not a CPA
    firm or tax advisory service.
  </p>
  <p>
    Every calculator's formulas are documented on its own page under "Methodology," with the specific
    IRS publication each figure is sourced from. Where a figure hasn't been directly verified against
    an official source yet, that's disclosed rather than presented as fact — see each calculator's
    "Limitations" section.
  </p>
  <p>
    This site does not provide personalized tax, legal, or financial advice. It provides general-purpose
    estimation tools based on publicly published federal tax rules. For advice specific to your
    situation, consult a licensed CPA, enrolled agent, or attorney.
  </p>
  <p>Questions or corrections: see the <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> page.</p>
</BaseLayout>
